{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "代理与实现",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 110.26,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "一个可升级合约，其实是两个合约。",
   "spoken": "一个可升级合约，其实是两个合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 3.191,
   "speechEnd": 6.303
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "代理合约，保存数据和资金。用户的每次调用，都先到它这里。",
   "spoken": "代理合约，保存数据和资金。用户的每次掉用，都先到它这里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 6.76,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 6.854,
   "speechEnd": 12.287
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "实现合约，只提供代码。",
   "spoken": "实现合约，只提供代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 12.74,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 12.74,
   "speechEnd": 14.822
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "代理用 delegatecall 把调用转给实现：借用实现的代码，读写的却是代理自己的存储。",
   "spoken": "代理用 delegatecall 把掉用转给实现：借用实现的代码，读写的却是代理自己的存储。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 15.28,
   "dur": 8.48,
   "speechStart": 15.372,
   "speechEnd": 23.516
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "升级，就是让代理指向一个新的实现。",
   "spoken": "升级，就是让代理指向一个新的实现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 23.98,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 23.98,
   "speechEnd": 26.98
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "数据和资金原地不动，只换代码。",
   "spoken": "数据和资金原地不动，只换代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 27.4,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 27.4,
   "speechEnd": 30.443
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "所以，谁能换实现，谁就拥有代理里的全部资金。",
   "spoken": "所以，谁能换实现，谁就拥有代理里的全部资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 30.82,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 30.82,
   "speechEnd": 35.106
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "打个比方。代理是一台售货机的机身，货和钱都在里面。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。代理是一台售货机的机身，货和钱都在里面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 35.52,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 35.618,
   "speechEnd": 40.573
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "实现是维修门后面的机芯，决定按下按钮以后，机器怎么动。",
   "spoken": "实现是维修门后面的机芯，决定按下按钮以后，机器怎么动。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 41.02,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 41.02,
   "speechEnd": 46.237
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "升级，就是打开维修门，换一块新机芯。",
   "spoken": "升级，就是打开维修门，换一块新机芯。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 46.68,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 46.68,
   "speechEnd": 50.332
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立：真实的机器换机芯要花时间。链上如果没有时间锁，换实现只要一笔交易。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立：真实的机器换机芯要花时间。链上如果没有时间锁，换实现只要一笔交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 50.74,
   "dur": 8.8,
   "speechStart": 50.84,
   "speechEnd": 59.35
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "常见的代理有三种，区别在于，升级的开关放在哪里。",
   "spoken": "常见的代理有三种，区别在于，升级的开关放在哪里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 59.76,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 59.855,
   "speechEnd": 64.402
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "第一种，透明代理。升级函数在代理里，由管理员调用。",
   "spoken": "第一种，透明代理。升级函数在代理里，由管理员掉用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 64.86,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 64.959,
   "speechEnd": 70.023
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "管理员调用代理时不转发，其他人的调用只转发，两边的函数就不会混淆。",
   "spoken": "管理员掉用代理时不转发，其他人的掉用只转发，两边的函数就不会混淆。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 70.44,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 70.534,
   "speechEnd": 76.39
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "第二种，UUPS。代理只做转发，升级函数写在实现合约里。",
   "spoken": "第二种，UUPS。代理只做转发，升级函数写在实现合约里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 76.82,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 76.82,
   "speechEnd": 82.46
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "风险是，新实现如果忘了带上升级函数，这个合约就再也不能升级。",
   "spoken": "风险是，新实现如果忘了带上升级函数，这个合约就再也不能升级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 82.88,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 82.973,
   "speechEnd": 88.64
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "第三种，信标代理。很多代理共用一个信标，信标里存着实现的地址。",
   "spoken": "第三种，信标代理。很多代理共用一个信标，信标里存着实现的地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 89.1,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 89.1,
   "speechEnd": 95.576
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "它适合大量相同的合约，比如每个用户一个金库。改一次信标，所有代理一起换。",
   "spoken": "它适合大量相同的合约，比如每个用户一个金库。改一次信标，所有代理一起换。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 95.96,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "speechStart": 95.96,
   "speechEnd": 103.41
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "三种模式都依赖 delegatecall，所以都有同一个风险：存储冲突。",
   "spoken": "三种模式都依赖 delegatecall，所以都有同一个风险：存储冲突。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-19.wav",
   "start": 103.86,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 103.86,
   "speechEnd": 108.88
  }
 ],
